<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2015/Buddy.jpg" alt="Portrait of Buddy" width="450" height="438" /></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Buddy. 12x12, oil on linen panel. 2015</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Started the morning by finishing up this painting of Buddy. &nbsp;It was painted using the customer's own photos as a reference. &nbsp;I tried to paint the whole thing in a loose style and integrate the body into the background as much as possible. The palette is ultramarine blue, burnt umber, burnt sienna and yellow ochre plus a little bit of alizarin crimson used at the end.</p>